{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JLNjBEBddrBnc27F2v2rFb","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines scoring rubric 1-10 scale site:corl2023.org\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Call for Papers — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/call-for-papers\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/\"},{\"title\":\"Best Reviewers Award for 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10957073/\"},{\"title\":\"Development and Validation of a Scoring Rubric for Editorial Evaluation of Peer-review Quality: A Pilot Study\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC11000557/\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10965318/\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10965321/\"}]\n\nI found the CoRL 2023 Reviewer Guidelines page, but the search results don't contain the specific 1-10 scoring rubric scale information. The page content shown includes guidance on reviewing papers and handling limitations, but doesn't display the scoring scale details.\n\nTo get the complete scoring rubric information, you may need to:\n1. Visit the full page directly at https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\n2. Look for additional documents or links on that page that may contain the scoring rubric\n\nThe search result snippet shows general reviewer guidelines such as \"be constructive and concrete; be courteous and respectful\" and how to handle limitations sections and obvious shortcomings, but the specific 1-10 scoring scale details aren't captured in the available search results.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fd00c091-cb94-4a78-