ated based on significance, novelty, and relevance to robotic learning), but the detailed rating scale definitions were not included in the snippets returned.\n\nTo find the specific rating scale you're looking for, you would need to visit the CoRL 2024 or CoRL 2025 OpenReview pages directly at:\n- https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2025/Conference (for CoRL 2025)\n- https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews (for CoRL 2024)\n\nThese pages should contain the complete reviewer guidelines with the specific rating scale definitions you mentioned.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fd00c091-cb94-4a78-804d-87db5c7a2985","uuid":"b7ee8d47-ef0d-405f-9331-82ee03d1789a","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:29:12.182Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2025 2024 review rating scale \"strong accept\" \"weak accept\" \"borderline\" \"weak reject\" \"strong reject\" openreview","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01CbTM1VjnBrHCqK9akTTUX9","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2025 | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2025"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Workshop Robot Data | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FWorkshop%2FRobot_Data"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Workshop Eval-Deploy | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FWorkshop%2FEval-Deploy"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Workshop RemembeRL | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FWorkshop%2FRemembeRL"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Workshop Open Hardware | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FWorkshop%2FOpen_Hardware"},{"title":"CoRL | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net